# ========== ДЕКОР: УЗОРЫ ИЗ КВАДРАТИКОВ ==========
decor_turtles = []
for _ in range(60):  # 60 квадратиков по всему экрану
    decor = turtle.Turtle()
    decor.shape("square")
    decor.shapesize(0.3, 0.3)
    decor.color(random.choice(["gray", "darkgray", "lightgray", "white"]))
    decor.penup()
    decor.speed(0)
    x = random.randint(-380, 380)
    y = random.randint(-280, 280)
    decor.goto(x, y)
    decor_turtles.append(decor)
# =================================================
for d in decor_turtles:
        if random.random() < 0.02:
            d.color(random.choice(["gray", "darkgray", "dim gray"]))
